---
import '../../styles/layout-proposals.css';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="ja">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <title>導入ページ レイアウト提案</title>
    <meta name="description" content="技術同人誌の2ページ目と3ページ目を想定した5つのレイアウト提案" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <main class="proposal-book">
      <section class="proposal-page neon neon-welcome">
        <div class="grid" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="orb orb-lime" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="proposal-copy">
          <p class="eyebrow">PROPOSAL 01 / NEON WELCOME SPREAD</p>
          <h1>はじめに</h1>
          <p class="lead">本を手に取っていただき、<br />ありがとうございます。</p>
          <p class="body-copy">AI、Astro、Vivliostyleを使った書籍制作を、原稿からPDFまで一緒に見ていきます。</p>
          <p class="formula">AI × ASTRO × VIVLIOSTYLE</p>
        </div>
        <span class="page-mark">02</span>
      </section>

      <section class="proposal-page neon neon-cards">
        <p class="eyebrow">THIS BOOK IS ABOUT</p>
        <h2>読む前にわかる、<br /><span>この本の3つのポイント</span></h2>
        <div class="card-grid">
          <article class="card card-cyan"><b>01</b><strong>BOOK PROJECT</strong><p>MarkdownからPDFまで</p></article>
          <article class="card card-lime"><b>02</b><strong>FOR BEGINNERS</strong><p>経験がなくても読める本</p></article>
          <article class="card card-coral"><b>03</b><strong>TOOLKIT</strong><p>VS Code / Copilot / Astro</p></article>
        </div>
        <p class="footer-label">AI × MARKDOWN × PDF</p>
        <span class="page-mark">03</span>
      </section>

      <section class="proposal-page roadmap roadmap-flow">
        <div class="roadmap-side"><span>PROPOSAL 02</span><strong>MAKE<br />A BOOK</strong></div>
        <div class="roadmap-content">
          <p class="eyebrow">PRODUCTION ROADMAP</p>
          <h2>本ができるまでを<br /><em>4つの工程</em>で見る</h2>
          <div class="steps">
            <div class="step step-lime"><b>01</b><strong>原稿を書く</strong><small>Markdown</small></div>
            <div class="step step-cyan"><b>02</b><strong>HTMLにする</strong><small>Astro</small></div>
            <div class="step step-purple"><b>03</b><strong>CSSで整える</strong><small>HTML + CSS</small></div>
            <div class="step step-coral"><b>04</b><strong>PDFにする</strong><small>Vivliostyle</small></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <span class="page-mark">02</span>
      </section>

      <section class="proposal-page roadmap roadmap-before-after">
        <p class="eyebrow">FROM SOURCE TO BOOK</p>
        <h2>原稿が一冊の本になる</h2>
        <div class="before-after">
          <div class="source-box"><span>BEFORE</span><strong>Markdownの原稿</strong><small>文章 / コード / 図表</small></div>
          <div class="arrow">＋<small>Astro + CSS + Vivliostyle</small>↓</div>
          <div class="source-box result"><span>AFTER</span><strong>A5判の技術同人誌PDF</strong><small>読める / 印刷できる / 届けられる</small></div>
        </div>
        <div class="tags"><span>経験がない方</span><span>本を作りたい方</span><span>AIを活用したい方</span></div>
        <span class="page-mark">03</span>
      </section>

      <section class="proposal-page toolbox toolbox-cards">
        <div class="toolbox-label">PROPOSAL 03 / TOOLBOX</div>
        <h2>本書で使う<br /><span>TOOLBOX</span></h2>
        <div class="tools">
          <div><b>#</b><strong>Markdown</strong><small>原稿を書く</small></div>
          <div><b>&gt;_</b><strong>VS Code</strong><small>ファイルを編集する</small></div>
          <div><b>AI</b><strong>Copilot</strong><small>AIに相談する</small></div>
          <div><b>&lt;/&gt;</b><strong>Astro</strong><small>HTMLを作る</small></div>
          <div><b>{ }</b><strong>CSS</strong><small>見た目を整える</small></div>
          <div><b>PDF</b><strong>Vivliostyle</strong><small>PDFにする</small></div>
        </div>
        <span class="page-mark">02</span>
      </section>

      <section class="proposal-page toolbox toolbox-equation">
        <p class="eyebrow">PUT THE TOOLS TOGETHER</p>
        <h2>道具を組み合わせて、<br /><span>一冊の本を作る</span></h2>
        <div class="equation">
          <div class="equation-item eq-lime"><b>原稿</b><small>WRITE</small></div>
          <strong>+</strong>
          <div class="equation-item eq-cyan"><b>デザイン</b><small>DESIGN</small></div>
          <strong>+</strong>
          <div class="equation-item eq-purple"><b>組版</b><small>LAYOUT</small></div>
          <strong>=</strong>
          <div class="equation-item eq-coral result"><b>技術同人誌</b><small>BOOK</small></div>
        </div>
        <p class="closing">小さな道具を、順番に使っていきます。</p>
        <span class="page-mark">03</span>
      </section>

      <section class="proposal-page mission mission-brief">
        <div class="mission-grid" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="mission-copy">
          <p class="eyebrow">PROPOSAL 04 / MISSION BRIEF</p>
          <p class="mission-code">MISSION 00</p>
          <h2>AIと一緒に<br /><span>技術同人誌を作る</span></h2>
          <div class="status"><span>STATUS</span><strong>BEGINNER FRIENDLY</strong></div>
          <div class="status"><span>OUTPUT</span><strong>A5 PDF BOOK</strong></div>
        </div>
        <span class="page-mark">02</span>
      </section>

      <section class="proposal-page mission mission-checklist">
        <p class="eyebrow">MISSION CHECKLIST</p>
        <h2>完成条件を<br /><span>チェックする</span></h2>
        <ul class="checklist">
          <li><b>01</b><span>Markdownで原稿を書く</span></li>
          <li><b>02</b><span>AstroでHTMLを生成する</span></li>
          <li><b>03</b><span>CSSでレイアウトを整える</span></li>
          <li><b>04</b><span>VivliostyleでPDFを出力する</span></li>
        </ul>
        <div class="mission-meta"><span>TARGET</span> これから始める人　<span>THEME</span> Neon Study Deck</div>
        <span class="page-mark">03</span>
      </section>

      <section class="proposal-page poster poster-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">PROPOSAL 05 / POSTER SPREAD</p>
        <div class="poster-lines">
          <strong>本を作る。</strong>
          <strong>コードを書く。</strong>
          <strong>AIに相談する。</strong>
          <strong>PDFにする。</strong>
        </div>
        <p class="poster-caption">A SMALL BOOK PROJECT<br />WITH BIG IDEAS</p>
        <span class="page-mark">02</span>
      </section>

      <section class="proposal-page poster poster-blocks">
        <p class="eyebrow">WRITE / DESIGN / PUBLISH</p>
        <div class="poster-block block-write"><b>WRITE</b><span>Markdownで書く</span></div>
        <div class="poster-block block-design"><b>DESIGN</b><span>CSSで整える</span></div>
        <div class="poster-block block-publish"><b>PUBLISH</b><span>PDFで届ける</span></div>
        <p class="poster-caption">5 PROPOSALS / 10 PAGES / 1 BOOK</p>
        <span class="page-mark">03</span>
      </section>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
